		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Midnight black scales cover this 60-foot-long dragon, and lava drips from its jaws. Violent, rageful, pedantic.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +8 (2d8) or 1 magma breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Magma Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) of volcanic magma, extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 4d6 damage. Magma puddles remain hot for 1d4 rounds, 2d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Magmablood</strong>. Fire immune. Double damage from cold.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
